{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting the Client"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Overcoming Obstacles"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>In the workplace, you will often be requested to offer your two cents. There are several ways to give suggestions. </p><p>Here are four ways to give advice:</p>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Use a <span class=\"strong\">modal verb</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">should</span> be generous and make a good offer.<br/>You <span class=\"strong\">could</span> be generous and make a good offer.<br/>You <span class=\"strong\">ought to</span> be generous and make a good offer.</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">NOTE:</span> <span class=\"italic\">Should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> are stronger than <span class=\"italic\">could</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Use a <span class=\"strong\">question</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Why don't you</span> offer something reasonable?<br/><span class=\"strong\">How about</span> offering something more reasonable? </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Put yourself in the person's shoes</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If I were you, I would</span> offer something more reasonable.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Use<span class=\"strong\"> negative forms</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">You don't want to</span> look cheap by making a low offer.<br/><span class=\"strong\">You shouldn't</span> make a low offer.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Dealing with Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>On a daily basis, we are faced with unpleasant situations. Although it is tempting to ignore them, it is far better to deal with problems as they arise. </p><p>Here are three ways to deal with problems:</p>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Acknowledging the problem</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to acknowledge the existence of a problem"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ve come across</span> a critical issue: the website is already in use.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Asking for help</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use modal verbs to ask for help dealing with a problem"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Should </span>I offer them something?<br/>What <span class=\"strong\">would </span>you suggest I do in a situation like this?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Explaining the problem</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Simple</span> tense to explain a problem and connect it using an adverb clause with \u201c<span class=\"italic\">because</span>\u201d"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">is </span>a problem for us <span class=\"strong\">because </span>we don't have enough knowledge.<br/>This can <span class=\"strong\">be </span>a tricky situation <span class=\"strong\">because </span>we don't know the owner of the website.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "minimal "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the smallest amount possible"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She only went online last year and sales are minimal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you might use in different business situations."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to gross"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make or earn before any deductions such as taxes have been removed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Records show she is grossing less than $10, 000 a year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "domain name"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an address on the internet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The domain name is already owned by an older woman. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "demanded price"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an amount of money that is asked for"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should double her demanded price. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "per annum"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "for each year"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We ought to acknowledge her effort per annum."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le09ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of 2 -3 problems you are having at the office or in the classroom."}, {"type": "