uch about the owner. If I were you I would ask what she'd be willing to take. You don't want to look ridiculous by offering too high or too low.<br/>\nJanet", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le09ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "58500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hello?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hi Janet. Sorry to bother you. It's Miranda here. I just didn't want to send you a dozen emails.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: No problem. Is this about the domain name?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. It's owned by an older woman. She asked for $5000! That's not enough! Should I offer her something we'd consider reasonable?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Of course! We ought to give her a year's worth of sales. Why don't you suggest doubling her demanded price? We shouldn't make a low offer. We should come off generous. We ought to acknowledge her effort per annum.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Splendid! I'll let you know how it goes.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le09ob07re2img07.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}], "id": 0}]}